  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切開。馬鈴薯被橫向切開，一塊又一塊，拋進沸騰的水裡。被手術刀切開的顱骨則要硬得多。\n撕扯。人體最柔軟的組織，就和棉花糖一樣，只要被戴著膠套的手輕輕一撕就會散落一地。\n揉碎。花朵在顫抖的掌心被揉成一團，鮮豔的汁水把掌心弄得很黏很黏，還弄髒了新買的皮鞋。\n尖叫。只要神經被儀器切斷的速度足夠快，就和巨量的麻醉劑一樣，能在不被注意的情況下奪走生命。\n哭泣。我死去的兄弟在手術台上哭泣。為什麼被殺死的是他們？為什麼被迫活下來的人是我？\n不。不。\n他們還沒有死去。他們就站在我身後，拼命地捶打和呐喊。\n從來都沒有什麼花園。有的只有殘酷的囚禁、切割、擺弄我們生命的樊籠。\n他們想要毀去這座樊籠。\n我也想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實驗室的外牆正在......被撕碎？這都是最新最堅硬的材料打造的，怎麼會......就跟馬鈴薯一樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "迷迭香。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她可能失控了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這是我最不想看見的事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇哇！那邊的地面正在跟蘋果皮一樣捲起來呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再這樣下去，我們都會變成壓扁的果泥吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "得有人去拉住她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭可以安撫迷迭香，但她不在這裡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我去試試......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你該不會是想自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒看見嗎？動力甲都跟個小紙片一樣被她撕來撕去，你只是個尋常的人類欸！你真的只是個人類吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如假包換。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那我也不會丟下迷迭香。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "伊芙利特？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是開玩笑的啊伊芙芙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你體內的炎魔......唔，你的力量本來也很危險，你該不會是想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會用它的力量。我自己去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......我和迷迭香之間的約定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "動力甲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "申請......支援......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "動力甲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊器......被捏碎了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "動力甲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別喊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "動力甲士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_526_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你想喊那兩個字，但別喊出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是我的朋友，我很喜歡的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不止是朋友。我們還是同事，可以走在一條路上勾肩搭背，一起揍敵人的同事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不正確的，我都會毀掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的實驗室，本來就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來就不該存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想說的，我都明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這該死的白大褂，混蛋的實驗室，那些害我們倒楣的玩意，早就該一把火全部燒掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們當然有資格憤怒，有資格叫罵，有資格毀掉這一切！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們同樣可以不用這麼做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要......擋在正確的路前面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好強......但是......也沒什麼大不了的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香，我不會讓你和達莉婭一樣，在我面前......我們約好了一起好好看看這座城市，也約好了要一起回到羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我不太想承認，但你一直比我厲害得多！你已經是羅德島的精英幹員了，你做過很多很多了不起的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想阿米婭，想想那個叫煌的大貓，想想博士！他們的手掌很軟，他們衣服上的味道很乾淨，他們的擁抱就像最厚實的毯子一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毯子......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不是沒有人愛的。生活一點都不公平，可那些混蛋的遭遇，最後還是讓我們遇見了那些很好的好人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫默講的故事總有個好結局，我知道的，她有時候都是自己在胡編亂造。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭嚴格地檢查我的作業，還會一遍遍在我跌倒的時候扶起我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些好的回憶不該被一起毀掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，迷迭香......可以停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停......下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙......芙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "震動減弱了。\n伊芙利特抓住了迷迭香的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，伊芙利特。你記得我的。哈哈，你才不會忘了我。我偷偷吃掉了你藏起來的餅乾，你還沒有發現呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......好像是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "餅乾少掉了。不是博士幹的。我應該在終端上改正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看起來很痛。為什麼......要笑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是要笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有失控，對不對？就連博士都在擔心，你會失控。其實你只是想用自己的方式，做你想做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要緊，塞雷婭也成天擔心我失去控制。這不是不信任，就當成是他們在瞎操心好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於那些壞人......他們種在我們身體裡的力量，留在我們身上的傷痕，都沒有辦法操控我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有我們自己才可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們要反過來，大聲嘲笑他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......像這樣就可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，彎起嘴角。去找那個洛肯，告訴他，他對你來說，什麼都不是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......洛肯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我會去找他。我知道該怎麼說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安靜了下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙利特成功了，她安撫住了迷迭香。呼......可真是逃過一劫呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迷迭香的源石技藝在你周圍的牆面上留下了大量的裂痕。\n迷宮的牆被打碎了，建築的更深處露出另一條走廊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "繆爾賽思，前面的房間是幹什麼的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我看見......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g10_ecolab"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡是......生態園。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你的生態園。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "繆爾賽思，為什麼聚焦發生器裡也有生態園？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "它與洛肯的實驗室相連。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰......沒有忘記啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "還有，那最裡面的東西是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“石棺”。\n你確信自己看見了石棺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_graduate"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你不會看錯，那是你現在所擁有的記憶的起點......\n甚至此刻的暈眩感都如出一轍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "洛肯在幫克麗斯騰研究石棺？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "克麗斯騰需要石棺做什麼？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她想自毀嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她會變成身披白毛的奇怪生物！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "繆爾賽思？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "繆爾賽思沒有回答你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你伸了伸手，但什麼都沒有碰觸到。\n你的身旁，只剩下一朵小小的水花，一團輕柔的泡影。\n真正的繆爾賽思，已經站在了生態園的最深處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你要離開我？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你要離開我們？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......我答應了會帶你和迷迭香見到洛肯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然目的已經達成，那我們的合作就到此為止吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不能再前進了。我們需要在這裡說再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你一開始就是這麼計劃的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以你才能要到這裡的地址。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我其實又騙了一個人，哈哈，我是不是真的很壞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜斯提那個直性子、木腦袋......我騙她說我當時已經做出了決定。其實我沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到剛剛，看到這座生態園的這一刻，我才做出了選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我過來，只是希望能確認一件事......是的，我的夢想在這裡。這個生態園，它所承載的未來......就是我的夢想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "屬於我和我的族人的生命的答案，都在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰答應過我，會帶著它一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒有騙我，她只是沒有告訴我......或許她已經厭煩了我的兩面三刀，我的心不在焉，或許她覺得我們之間的信任從未更易......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她真的這樣做了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也該遵守我與她之間的約定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也請你告訴塞雷婭......對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "水流湧向你，將你推離，依舊是輕柔的，但又不容拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你回到了外層走廊上，生態實驗室的大門在你面前緩緩地關閉。\n水流消失，沒有留下任何痕跡。你的手再一次空了，只不過這次不再是舞曲中間一次曼妙的轉場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g11_monitoringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間就快到了，我是不是可以走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交易已經完成。你隨時都可以離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你答應我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的終端已經收到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是......洛肯所有的研究成果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，還有一個地址......模糊的地址。哈哈，看起來還挺眼熟。你還真是在梅蘭德的眼皮子底下做了不少事啊，我都快要更佩服你一些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看不到你本來能看到的天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些星星？我的族人們擺弄它們的時間已經夠久了。該給的情報，我都給過你，你依然覺得那些扭曲的光點值得一看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是現在的天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而是它未來的，真正的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了。我知道你的宏偉藍圖，但那樣的未來不屬於我。只要你的資料真實可靠，我馬上就能完成先祖們的宏願，取回我真正的力量——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要的力量，甚至沒能抵禦時間。你很清楚，在未來的天空上翱翔的，可能是機器，可能是其他不斷進化的生命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不會是來自萬年之前的幻影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在嘲弄我......嘲弄我的血統，我的記憶，我的使命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不惜犧牲全族人的壽命，只是為了回到過去......這一切真的有價值嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。反正該拿的東西我都拿到了，就讓我們體面地說聲再見吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霍爾海雅輕輕躍下監視平台。\n她沒有轉身去看克麗斯騰的臉，因為她一點都不想讓對方看見自己此刻的神情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g3_rhinelab_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又見面啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霍爾海雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人無言片刻。\n過去與未來擦身而過，向來沒有交集。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_aircraft_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門......呃，推不開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......您借給我的武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我借給你的。這已經是你的了。你只是還需要一些練習，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "練習......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從這裡出去，你就自由了。特工與士兵們都自顧不暇。他們找到了聚焦發生器，達到了目的，不會再為難你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以往特里蒙城區的方向跑。到了那裡，你依然還是赫默研究員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還想往最危險的地方跑。對嗎？那樣的話，你不僅可能遭遇生命危險，還可能再也擺脫不了梅蘭德的視線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這將是一生的纏鬥。你或許會永遠失去一些東西，自由，生活，親人朋友的絕對信任，生活在陽光下的權利，還有你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的要投身到這樣的生活裡去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。我還沒有親眼......看到問題得到解決。我不想中途放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是個有天賦的學者，善良的醫生。現在你考慮好了，要學著成為一名戰士了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許......我永遠成為不了戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可如果有必要的話，我會握緊您給我的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，孩子。帶著我的祝福前進吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您，雅拉主任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，總轄......克麗斯騰可能就在前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不想見她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想......嗎？怎麼可能呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_893_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，我恐怕追不上她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雅拉注視著不遠處的實驗室。\n過了一會，她的視線移向上空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g17_corridor_symmetry"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搜到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續。聚焦發生器的核心裝置就在這裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布萊克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有克麗斯騰......她不可能再從我們眼皮子底下逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......伊芙利特？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭！怎麼樣，你找到進去的方法了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這地方真的好奇怪，就算迷迭香跟捏碎餅乾一樣把實驗室的外牆弄塌了大部分，裡面的東西還是一點都沒露出來啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這不是一棟完整的建築。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙利特，你說得對。這不是一個實驗室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她難道把她父母的推進器裝在了......這怎麼可能？我怎麼......我怎麼現在才想到？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙利特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_895_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭！你準備去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是......打穿這面牆的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不可能猜不到我會來。這沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那什麼才有意義呢？\n你什麼都改變不了。\n會不會已經遲了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一定要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫......默？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該離開這裡......這裡很有可能會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，我不是為了聽你說這些話才來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我瞭解一個科學家為了自己的夢想可以做到什麼地步。我體會過那近乎癡狂的感覺，才知道想要用道德去對抗它需要多大的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，一直以來你都在找尋科研與秩序之間的平衡。你做得很好，或許好得過了頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的秩序正在崩塌，但如果放棄平衡的話，或許......你能在混亂中找回你自己的源頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找回......源頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信你可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都有各自要做的事，就在這裡分開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，塞雷婭，現在我可以告訴你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g10_ecolab"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，難得交到的聊得來的朋友就這樣沒有啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "avg_249_mlyss_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰，你要怎麼賠我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "納西莎......你回到了我面前。你做好宣判的準備了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我想殺死你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是為了報復。我恨你，但阿米婭和博士都說，報復並不能讓那些消失了的我愛的人回到我身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是為了摧毀。你想借我的手來毀掉你自己，我不願意。我不是你的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對我來說什麼都不是，只是一名罪犯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法律和監獄都做不到的事，我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我宣判你的死刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那首歌是怎麼唱的來著......對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鄉間的路♪帶我回家♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我落葉歸根♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛肯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_894_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快了，就快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劇烈的震動，從地底傳到腳面。\n就像有什麼極為頑強的生命正要破土而出一樣。\n你注視著不遠處的內層走廊不斷地上升，並透過窗戶看到了一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g3_rhinelab_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克麗斯騰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_537_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "克麗斯騰。\n這個名字最近被反反覆覆地提及。\n瘋子。天才。敵人。朋友。\n又或者......只是一個不屬於這個時代的癡人。\n這是你第一次看到她的樣子。而她依舊仰頭看著天空，彷彿什麼都沒有的那處空白才是她唯一需要在意的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g4_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "怎麼......回事？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "站不穩了！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個熟悉的身影出現在你面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖嘯）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "它在瞬間舒展了自己的身軀，尖銳的爪子輕輕抓住了你的肩膀，龐大的身形將你完全籠罩。\n很快，更為巨大的陰影在Mon3tr身後升起。\n聚焦發生器。\n你直到此刻才得以確認，眼前這神秘的環形走廊以及繆爾賽思的生態園，都是聚焦發生器的一部分。\n梅蘭德與軍方為它爭鬥不休，又握手言和，可沒人猜到它會以這種形式出現在所有人面前。\n推進器的火焰幾乎刺痛了你的雙眼，激烈的氣流讓你失去平衡。\n你相信，要不是有凱爾希和Mon3tr在，你會被立刻掀飛——就像你周圍的其他人和整間破破爛爛的實驗室一樣，被狠狠地拋開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，抓穩一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我看到了“石棺”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我沒料到克麗斯騰的實驗室能飛。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們明明就快接近真相......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你發現半空中那個人把視線投向了你們。\n不，不是你們。她看的是護著你的漆黑怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（似有所感的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "克麗斯騰動了動嘴唇，似乎發出了一次詢問。\n你聽到凱爾希重複了一遍剛才對你的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
